Package: totalevalerror
Title: Total Eval Error: Variance Decomposition and D-Study for LLM
    Evaluation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Solomon", "Messing", , "solomon.messing@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Decomposes uncertainty in LLM-based evaluation into a crossed
    random-effects mixed model, projects standard errors under
    hypothetical evaluation designs (D-study), and recommends pilot sizes
    and budget allocations. Implements the methods from Messing (2026),
    Total Eval Error.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
